msgctxt "184"
msgid "Good morning, Kiryu-san. It's nice to see you today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "You came back, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Please help us raise another number one hostess! I'm sure\r\n"
"you can do it, no problem!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Well, let's get right down to business. You'll need to hit\r\n"
"the streets and scout for some fresh new talent. Koji will\r\n"
"be here to help you with anything you don't understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Actually, there's a girl named Natsume who works at the\r\n"
"club..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"She's the number one hostess on the roster. She's pretty,\r\n"
"she brings in the crowd... She's even got wealthy members of\r\n"
"the elite wrapped around her finger. It's unbelievable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Oh. That's a good thing, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"Well, not exactly. Natsume has started using her status as\r\n"
"leverage to influence the club's business decisions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"On top of that, she's developed a terrible attitude at work,\r\n"
"and it seems she wants me fired from the club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Oh... Why don't you fire her first, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"I can't do that. She's responsible for so much of our\r\n"
"revenue that losing her would completely be the end of us.\r\n"
"Sassy as she is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"I just don't understand how a person could start out with\r\n"
"such passion and optimism, yet turn out so cold and\r\n"
"conniving... Maybe if I wasn't such a fool of a manager..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Oh, well if it isn't our hard-working \"manager.\" Just what\r\n"
"are you plotting over here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Oh! Natsume-chan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Hmm, haven't seen you around here before. Well, doesn't matter. I'm off to "
"Hawaii as it is. Hold down the fort for me, 'kay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Hey, you can't just up and abandon us! This is your job!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Not to burst your bubble, but my ride's almost here. Catch\r\n"
"you later, daddio!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Aggghhhh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "(He really has no control over her, huh?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "...Hey, wait! I just had the best idea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Why don't you work at our club for a while?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"It'll be great! You come work for us, bring in some cash for\r\n"
"yourself, and coach a fine young lady to knock Natsume off her throne!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"I have a hunch that she's the type that'll only come to her\r\n"
"senses once she loses that top position."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"And I'll admit my leadership hasn't amounted to much... But\r\n"
"I'm sure you've got the grit to get the job done. So! When\r\n"
"can you start!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "You're asking the wrong guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Oh, don't say that! Our staff here will be more than happy\r\n"
"to give you all the support you need. Won't you reconsider?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"Well, I don't know if I'll be of much help... but I suppose\r\n"
"I could give it a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Trust me, you'd be helping us out plenty!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Allow me to introduce myself, then. I'm Sakaki, and you are?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "I'm Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Kiryu-san, I'd like you to recruit a new hostess right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"Wait, I'm not going to be coaching the hostesses already\r\n"
"working for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid all our girls have fallen under Natsume's\r\n"
"spell, so there won't be much you can do. It'd be far more\r\n"
"effective to start with someone you brought in yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "...I guess that makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"Also, here are some operating funds. Sorry it's not much,\r\n"
"but it'll be useful for at least a few major expenses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"Let's hop right to it, then. I'll have one of our staff\r\n"
"members bring you up to speed... Ah, how about Koji?\r\n"
"He'll know what to do."
msgstr ""

